\"metatag\";a:3:{i:0;a:2:{s:3:\"tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:10:\"attributes\";a:2:{s:4:\"name\";s:5:\"title\";s:7:\"content\";s:199:\"Mirada Pokémon Pikachu Soft Plush Toy – 22cm | Official Licensed Stuffed for Kids, Boys & Girls | Super Soft Cuddly Character Toy for Fans | Ideal for Birthday Gifts/Christmas/Diwali | ReviewLikes\";}}i:1;a:2:{s:3:\"tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:10:\"attributes\";a:2:{s:4:\"name\";s:11:\"description\";s:7:\"content\";s:383:\"OFFICIALLY LICENSED CHARACTER : Mirada presents an authentic Pokémon Pikachu plush, officially licensed and designed with precise character detailing. This premium soft toy reflects the original charm of Pikachu while ensuring trusted quality and originality. It builds strong buyer confidence, making it an ideal choice for parents and fans seeking a genuine collectible companion.\";}}i:2;a:2:{s:3:\"tag\";s:4:\"link\";s:10:\"attributes\";a:2:{s:3:\"rel\";s:9:\"canonical\";s:4:\"href\";s:37:\"http://localhost/review_likes/node/64\";}}}s:4:\"body\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:1802:\"OFFICIALLY LICENSED CHARACTER : Mirada presents an authentic Pokémon Pikachu plush, officially licensed and designed with precise character detailing. This premium soft toy reflects the original charm of Pikachu while ensuring trusted quality and originality. It builds strong buyer confidence, making it an ideal choice for parents and fans seeking a genuine collectible companion.\r\nULTRA-SOFT & HUGGABLE : Crafted from high-quality plush fabric, this Pikachu toy offers exceptional softness and a smooth, skin-friendly feel. Perfect for cuddling, playtime, or bedtime comfort, it provides a soothing experience for children. Its gentle texture supports emotional bonding, making it a cozy companion for everyday relaxation and imaginative play.\r\nDESIGN & VISUAL APPEAL : Featuring vibrant tones and expressive Pikachu detailing, this plush captures attention instantly. Its cute and playful design encourages engagement while also serving as an attractive décor piece for kids’ rooms. The character’s friendly look enhances visual appeal and creates a joyful, imaginative environment for children.\r\nSAFE & DURABLE BUILD : Made with strong stitching and child-safe materials, this plush ensures long-lasting durability for everyday use. It maintains its shape and softness even with regular handling. Parents can trust its safe construction, allowing children to enjoy worry-free play, cuddling, and carrying their favorite character wherever they go.\r\nPERFECT GIFT MOMENT : Thoughtfully designed for gifting, this Pikachu plush is ideal for birthdays, return gifts, and festive occasions. It brings joy, comfort, and excitement to children and Pokémon fans, making it a meaningful and reliable present. A trusted gifting option that combines quality, emotional value, and everyday usability.\r\n\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"plain_text\";s:9:\"processed\";s:1840:\"<p>OFFICIALLY LICENSED CHARACTER : Mirada presents an authentic Pokémon Pikachu plush, officially licensed and designed with precise character detailing. This premium soft toy reflects the original charm of Pikachu while ensuring trusted quality and originality. It builds strong buyer confidence, making it an ideal choice for parents and fans seeking a genuine collectible companion.<br />\nULTRA-SOFT &amp; HUGGABLE : Crafted from high-quality plush fabric, this Pikachu toy offers exceptional softness and a smooth, skin-friendly feel. Perfect for cuddling, playtime, or bedtime comfort, it provides a soothing experience for children. Its gentle texture supports emotional bonding, making it a cozy companion for everyday relaxation and imaginative play.<br />\nDESIGN &amp; VISUAL APPEAL : Featuring vibrant tones and expressive Pikachu detailing, this plush captures attention instantly. Its cute and playful design encourages engagement while also serving as an attractive décor piece for kids’ rooms. The character’s friendly look enhances visual appeal and creates a joyful, imaginative environment for children.<br />\nSAFE &amp; DURABLE BUILD : Made with strong stitching and child-safe materials, this plush ensures long-lasting durability for everyday use. It maintains its shape and softness even with regular handling. Parents can trust its safe construction, allowing children to enjoy worry-free play, cuddling, and carrying their favorite character wherever they go.<br />\nPERFECT GIFT MOMENT : Thoughtfully designed for gifting, this Pikachu plush is ideal for birthdays, return gifts, and festive occasions. It brings joy, comfort, and excitement to children and Pokémon fans, making it a meaningful and reliable present. A trusted gifting option that combines quality, emotional value, and everyday usability.</p>\n\";s:7:\"summary\";N;s:17:\"summary_processed\";s:0:\"\";}}s:17:\"field_advertising\";a:0:{}s:17:\"field_external_id\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}s:25:\"field_legal_business_name\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";s:2:\"22\";}}s:19:\"field_platform_link\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:\"target_type\";s:9:\"paragraph\";s:11:\"target_uuid\";s:36:\"dcd93673-6eab-427a-bdef-a9fb50569415\";}}s:11:\"field_price\";a:0:{}s:12:\"field_prices\";a:1:{i:0;a:3:{s:5:\"value\";s:5:\"bgffg\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"plain_text\";s:9:\"processed\";s:13:\"<p>bgffg</p>\n\";}}s:21:\"field_product_url_new\";a:1:{i:0;a:3:{s:3:\"uri\";s:129:\"amazon.in/Mirada-Pokémon-Pikachu-Soft-Toy/dp/B0F249YST5?psc=1&pd_rd_w=qwIjD&content-id=amzn1.sym.da5fe39d-5f69-4386-b6c9-31e67e2\";s:5:\"title\";N;s:7:\"options\";a:0:{}}}s:23:\"field_product_variation\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";b:1;}}s:12:\"field_rating\";a:0:{}s:16:\"field_rating_new\";a:0:{}s:22:\"field_show_in_homepage\";a:0:{}s:14:\"field_sold_bys\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";s:22:\"Visit the Mirada Store\";}}s:21:\"field_testified_video\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";b:0;}}s:16:\"field_tests_done\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";i:3;}}s:23:\"field_trending_products\";a:0:{}s:13:\"_content_sync\";a:2:{s:11:\"entity_type\";s:4:\"nod