d comfort for both children and adults PERFECT SIZE: Measures 30 cm in height, 15 cm in length, and 20 cm in width, making it an ideal companion for bedtime, travel, or display without taking up excessive space\";}}i:2;a:2:{s:3:\"tag\";s:4:\"link\";s:10:\"attributes\";a:2:{s:3:\"rel\";s:9:\"canonical\";s:4:\"href\";s:37:\"http://localhost/review_likes/node/91\";}}}s:4:\"body\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:871:\"ADORABLE DESIGN: Features a charming calico cat plush with realistic brown and orange patches, expressive black eyes, pink nose, and an orange collar for an endearing lifelike appearance\r\nPREMIUM QUALITY MATERIAL: Crafted from soft cotton material that provides a huggable, cuddly texture perfect for snuggling and comfort for both children and adults\r\nPERFECT SIZE: Measures 30 cm in height, 15 cm in length, and 20 cm in width, making it an ideal companion for bedtime, travel, or display without taking up excessive space\r\nVERSATILE GIFTING OPTION: Makes an excellent gift for birthdays, Diwali, Valentine\'s Day, or any special occasion for girls, wives, girlfriends, boyfriends, husbands, kids, and adults alike\r\nSAFE FOR CHILDREN: Suitable for children aged 24 months and above, with no batteries required, weighing only 200 grams for easy handling and portability\r\n\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"plain_text\";s:9:\"processed\";s:902:\"<p>ADORABLE DESIGN: Features a charming calico cat plush with realistic brown and orange patches, expressive black eyes, pink nose, and an orange collar for an endearing lifelike appearance<br />\nPREMIUM QUALITY MATERIAL: Crafted from soft cotton material that provides a huggable, cuddly texture perfect for snuggling and comfort for both children and adults<br />\nPERFECT SIZE: Measures 30 cm in height, 15 cm in length, and 20 cm in width, making it an ideal companion for bedtime, travel, or display without taking up excessive space<br />\nVERSATILE GIFTING OPTION: Makes an excellent gift for birthdays, Diwali, Valentine&#039;s Day, or any special occasion for girls, wives, girlfriends, boyfriends, husbands, kids, and adults alike<br />\nSAFE FOR CHILDREN: Suitable for children aged 24 months and above, with no batteries required, weighing only 200 grams for easy handling and portability</p>\n\";s:7:\"summary\";N;s:17:\"summary_processed\";s:0:\"\";}}s:17:\"field_advertising\";a:0:{}s:17:\"field_external_id\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{i:0;a:8:{s:9:\"target_id\";i:190;s:3:\"alt\";s:13:\"Product Image\";s:5:\"title\";s:13:\"Product Image\";s:5:\"width\";i:355;s:6:\"height\";i:355;s:11:\"target_type\";s:4:\"file\";s:11:\"target_uuid\";s:36:\"a4a611d0-213c-4c4f-b704-ba5315c88930\";s:3:\"url\";s:103:\"http://localhost/review_likes/sites/default/files/products/product_1775451918_0_61sgpkzFcQL._SY355_.jpg\";}}s:25:\"field_legal_business_name\";a:0:{}s:19:\"field_platform_link\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_price\";a:0:{}s:12:\"field_prices\";a:0:{}s:21:\"field_product_url_new\";a:1:{i:0;a:3:{s:3:\"uri\";s:128:\"https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0GFWP3MB1/ref=sspa_dk_detail_1?pd_rd_i=B0GFWP3MB1&pd_rd_w=XTuL7&content-id=amzn1.sym.67d3dec9-3503-44a\";s:5:\"title\";N;s:7:\"options\";a:0:{}}}s:23:\"field_product_variation\";a:0:{}s:12:\"field_rating\";a:0:{}s:16:\"field_rating_new\";a:0:{}s:22:\"field_show_in_homepage\";a:0:{}s:14:\"field_sold_bys\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";s:21:\"Visit the Webby Store\";}}s:21:\"field_testified_video\";a:0:{}s:16:\"field_tests_done\";a:0:{}s:23:\"field_trending_products\";a:0:{}s:13:\"_content_sync\";a:2:{s:11:\"entity_type\";s:4:\"node\";s:19:\"entity_dependencies\";a:1:{s:4:\"user\";a:1:{i:0;s:46:\"user.user.1dad9096-3926-47f1-a664-ff674755dc29\";}}}}'),('node.marchant_products','node.marchant_products.5b6d2898-8749-4932-ac18-d2107675ddd3','a:36:{s:4:\"uuid\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";s:36:\"5b6d2898-8749-4932-ac18-d2107675ddd3\";}}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";s:2:\"en\";}}s:4:\"type\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"target_id\";s:17:\"marchant_products\";}}s:18:\"revi