ar for an endearing lifelike appearance<br />\nPREMIUM QUALITY MATERIAL: Crafted from soft cotton material that provides a huggable, cuddly texture perfect for snuggling and comfort for both children and adults<br />\nPERFECT SIZE: Measures 30 cm in height, 15 cm in length, and 20 cm in width, making it an ideal companion for bedtime, travel, or display without taking up excessive space<br />\nVERSATILE GIFTING OPTION: Makes an excellent gift for birthdays, Diwali, Valentine&#039;s Day, or any special occasion for girls, wives, girlfriends, boyfriends, husbands, kids, and adults alike<br />\nSAFE FOR CHILDREN: Suitable for children aged 24 months and above, with no batteries required, weighing only 200 grams for easy handling and portability</p>\n\";s:7:\"summary\";N;s:17:\"summary_processed\";s:0:\"\";}}s:17:\"field_advertising\";a:0:{}s:17:\"field_external_id\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:5:{i:0;a:8:{s:9:\"target_id\";i:229;s:3:\"alt\";s:13:\"Product Image\";s:5:\"title\";s:13:\"Product Image\";s:5:\"width\";i:355;s:6:\"height\";i:355;s:11:\"target_type\";s:4:\"file\";s:11:\"target_uuid\";s:36:\"37ea2f58-d7f5-4b55-908d-42a81df92ad8\";s:3:\"url\";s:103:\"http://localhost/review_likes/sites/default/files/products/product_1775453135_0_61sgpkzFcQL._SY355_.jpg\";}i:1;a:8:{s:9:\"target_id\";i:230;s:3:\"alt\";s:13:\"Product Image\";s:5:\"title\";s:13:\"Product Image\";s:5:\"width\";i:450;s:6:\"height\";i:450;s:11:\"target_type\";s:4:\"file\";s:11:\"target_uuid\";s:36:\"3b83ac7d-ae8f-40d4-88f5-9932176c44a6\";s:3:\"url\";s:103:\"http://localhost/review_likes/sites/default/files/products/product_1775453136_1_61sgpkzFcQL._SY450_.jpg\";}i:2;a:8:{s:9:\"target_id\";i:231;s:3:\"alt\";s:13:\"Product Image\";s:5:\"title\";s:13:\"Product Image\";s:5:\"width\";i:425;s:6:\"height\";i:425;s:11:\"target_type\";s:4:\"file\";s:11:\"target_uuid\";s:36:\"1a8c47bc-2729-4e28-acbe-2bb0c568e50a\";s:3:\"url\";s:103:\"http://localhost/review_likes/sites/default/files/products/product_1775453137