4:\"meta\";s:10:\"attributes\";a:2:{s:4:\"name\";s:11:\"description\";s:7:\"content\";s:521:\"Adorable Bunny Face Design: Our soft rattle features a cute bunny face that will instantly charm your little one. Multiple Interactive Sounds: Shake the rattle to produce a delightful rattling sound, and squeeze the handle to create another engaging sound. Gentle and Soothing Sound: The rattle\'s rattling sound captivates babies and provides a soothing experience, while the handle sound adds an interactive element. Premium Quality: Made from high-quality, baby-safe materials, ensuring durability and long-lasting use.\";}}i:2;a:2:{s:3:\"tag\";s:4:\"link\";s:10:\"attributes\";a:2:{s:3:\"rel\";s:9:\"canonical\";s:4:\"href\";s:37:\"http://localhost/review_likes/node/33\";}}}s:4:\"body\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:1367:\"Adorable Bunny Face Design: Our soft rattle features a cute bunny face that will instantly charm your little one.\nMultiple Interactive Sounds: Shake the rattle to produce a delightful rattling sound, and squeeze the handle to create another engaging sound.\nGentle and Soothing Sound: The rattle\'s rattling sound captivates babies and provides a soothing experience, while the handle sound adds an interactive element.\nPremium Quality: Made from high-quality, baby-safe materials, ensuring durability and long-lasting use.\nLightweight and Easy to Grip: Designed to be lightweight and easy for babies to hold, promoting motor skill development.\nStimulates Senses: The vibrant colors and multiple sounds stimulate your baby\'s visual, auditory, and tactile senses, aiding in their cognitive development.\nSafe for Babies: Our rattle is made from non-toxic materials and undergoes rigorous safety testing to ensure it meets the highest standards.\nEasy to Clean: The rattle can be easily cleaned, maintaining a hygienic playtime experience for your little one. Wash Instructions: Hand wash only with lukewarm water and mild detergent.\nVersatile and Portable: Perfect for playtime at home or on-the-go entertainment, making it a convenient companion for your baby.\nSuitable for All Genders: The adorable bunny face design makes it a versatile option for both boys and girls.\n\";s:6:\"format\";N;s:9:\"processed\";s:1438:\"<p>Adorable Bunny Face Design: Our soft rattle features a cute bunny face that will instantly charm your little one.<br />\nMultiple Interactive Sounds: Shake the rattle to produce a delightful rattling sound, and squeeze the handle to create another engaging sound.<br />\nGentle and Soothing Sound: The rattle&#039;s rattling sound captivates babies and provides a soothing experience, while the handle sound adds an interactive element.<br />\nPremium Quality: Made from high-quality, baby-safe materials, ensuring durability and long-lasting use.<br />\nLightweight and Easy to Grip: Designed to be lightweight and easy for babies to hold, promoting motor skill development.<br />\nStimulates Senses: The vibrant colors and multiple sounds stimulate your baby&#039;s visual, auditory, and tactile senses, aiding in their cognitive development.<br />\nSafe for Babies: Our rattle is made from non-toxic materials and undergoes rigorous safety testing to ensure it meets the highest standards.<br />\nEasy to Clean: The rattle can be easily cleaned, maintaining a hygienic playtime experience for your little one. Wash Instructions: Hand wash only with lukewarm water and mild detergent.<br />\nVersatile and Portable: Perfect for playtime at home or on-the-go entertainment, making it a convenient companion for your baby.<br />\nSuitable for All Genders: The adorable bunny face design makes it a versatile option for both boys and girls.</p>\n\";s:7:\"summary\";N;s:17:\"summary_processed\";s:0:\"\";}}s:17:\"field_external_id\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"value\";s:10:\"B0BZYWTKLB\";}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{i:0;a:8:{s:9:\"target_id\";i:37;s:3:\"alt\";N;s:5:\"title\";N;s:5:\"width\";i:153;s:6:\"height\";i:300;s:11:\"target_type\";s:4:\"file\";s:11