he highest standards.\nEasy to Clean: The rattle can be easily cleaned, maintaining a hygienic playtime experience for your little one. Wash Instructions: Hand wash only with lukewarm water and mild detergent.\nVersatile and Portable: Perfect for playtime at home or on-the-go entertainment, making it a convenient companion for your baby.\nSuitable for All Genders: The adorable bunny face design makes it a versatile option for both boys and girls.\n',NULL,NULL),('marchant_products',0,52,94,'en',0,'Perfect Gift for All Ages – This cute strawberry bunny zipper rabbit makes a thoughtful strawberry bunny toy zipper gift for birthdays, anniversaries, and special occasions. Ideal cuddly toy for girlfriend and loved ones.\r\nStrawberry rabbit plush – Made from ultra-soft plush rabbit stuffed toy fabric, perfect as soft toys for baby girl, kids toys for 2 - 5 years boy, and toys for 6 month old baby.\r\nThis Zip Bunny Soft Toy Strawberry Rabbit Crafted with ultra-soft fabric, this stuffed toy doubles as a pou pillow, providing comfort while being gentle on sensitive skin, suitable for both kids and adults.\r\nStuffed Animal Gifts Ideal as a birthday, Easter, or holiday gift for kids, teens, and even adults who appreciate cute, multi-functional plushies. fluffy rabbit soft toy\r\nKids Room Decor Plushie Perfect as a cute plush bunny, doll, teddy bear alternative, or sofa pillow, this medium-sized (30CM) bunny adds charm to any room or space.\r\nMulti-Purpose Plush Toy – Whether it\'s a teddy bear 30cm for girls or a smaller version, this zipper reversible strawberry bunny soft toy is great for play, bedtime, or home décor.\r\nDesigned for All Kids – A great pick among kids toys for 2 - 5 years girl, toys for 2+ year old boy, and toys for 6 year old girl – it’s a universal favorite! rabbit teddy bear\r\n',NULL,'plain_text'),('marchant_products',0,53,95,'en',0,'Ultra-Soft & Cuddly Material – Made from premium plush fabric that\'s gentle on skin and perfect for snuggles.\r\nSafe for All Ages – Crafted with child-safe stitching and non-toxic, hypoallergenic filling – ideal for babies, toddlers, and kids.\r\nPerfect Gift Idea – A charming companion for birthdays, baby showers, holidays, or just because – loved by boys and girls alike.\r\nDurable & Washable – Built to withstand playtime adventures; easy to clean with hand wash or gentle machine cycle.\r\nAdorable Design & Size – Cute and colorful character design with just the right size to fit in backpacks, cribs, or beds\r\n',NULL,'plain_text'),('marchant_products',0,54,96,'en',0,'<p>Made out of non-toxic polyester and fur fabrics of good quality Soft and Cuddly filling, Huggable and loveable for someone special, Teach your loved one the act of hugging with the help of these teddies Excellent Poly-staple &amp; conjugate filling fiber used has good resiliency making it most appropriate for machine or hand wash Size:-30 Cm</p>','','full_html'),('marchant_products',0,60,102,'en',0,'<p>SCOOBA adorable small cat soft toys for kids decor 25cm 🏆【Material】Soft plush made of high quality plush fabric, filled with soft fiber and realistic styling. 🏆【Comfortable hand feeling】 Soft plush, light weighted, attractive and huggable body. Perfect bed companion toy for kids sleeping. Smaller sized plush animals are in a bigger demand than large ones. Get ready to witness tons of smiles and many fine memories because of stuffed animals for kids ability to entertain and educate. 🏆【Washable】 This is Machine/Hand Washable. And do not forget to dry it fully under the sun frequently which helps keep the plush toy soft.</p>','','full_html'),('marchant_products',0,64,106,'en',0,'OFFICIALLY LICENSED CHARACTER : Mirada presents an authentic Pokémon Pikachu plush, officially licensed and designed with precise character detailing. This premium soft toy reflects the original charm of Pikachu while ensuring trusted quality and originality. It builds strong buyer confidence, making it an ideal choice for parents and fans seeking a genuine collectible companion.\r\nULTRA-SOFT & HUGGABLE : Crafted from high-quality plush fabric, this Pikachu toy offers exceptional softness and a smooth, skin-friendly feel. Perfect for cuddling, playtime, or bedtime comfort, it provides a soothing experience for children. Its gentle texture supports emotional bonding, making it a cozy companion for everyday relaxation and imaginative play.\r\nDESIGN & VISUAL APPEAL : Featuring vibrant tones and expressive Pikachu detailing, this plush captures attention instantly. Its cute and playful design encourages engagement while also serving as an attractive décor piece for kids’ rooms. The character’s friendly look enhances visual appeal and creates a joyful, imaginative environment for children.\r\nSAFE & DURABLE BUILD : Made with strong stitching and child-safe materials, this plush ensures long-lasting durability for everyday use. It maintains its shape and softness even with regular handling. Parents can trust its safe construction, allowing children to enjoy worry-free play, cuddling, and carrying their favorite character wherever they go.\r\nPERFECT GIFT MOMENT : Thoughtfully designed for gifting, this Pikachu plush is ideal for birthdays, return gifts, and festive occasions. It brings joy, comfort, and excitement to children and Pokémon fans, making it a meaningful and reliable present. A trusted gifting option that combines quality, emotional value, and everyday usability.\r\n',NULL,'plain_text'),('marchant_products',0,70,112,'en',0,'🏆【Material】Soft plush made of high quality plush fabric, filled with soft fiber and realistic styling.; 🏆【Perfect Size】 Size 28 cm, our soft toy is the perfect size for children to bring along in the car, airplane, in the bag, or simple to play with at home. Soft and cuddly, ensure safe use for your child\r\nMaterial Type: Polyester\r\n',NULL,'plain_text'),('marchant_products',0,75,117,'en',0,'ADORABLE DESIGN: Features a charming calico cat plush with realistic brown and ora